      ],
      "image": "assets/images/city.jpg",
      "excerpt": "At 05:20 a hand bell starts the auction at the Sakamachi market. We recorded the hour before it, when everybody is waiting and nobody is quiet.",
      "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"oto-listen\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group oto-listen\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"oto-listen__play\"} -->\n<p class=\"oto-listen__play\"><a href=\"https://feeds.example.com/oto-radio/43\">Listen</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"oto-listen__info\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group oto-listen__info\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"oto-listen__no\"} -->\n<p class=\"oto-listen__no\">Episode 43</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"oto-listen__time\"} -->\n<p class=\"oto-listen__time\">49 min</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-wave\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-wave\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"oto-listen__note\"} -->\n<p class=\"oto-listen__note\">Recorded on location and in Studio B. Plays in your podcast app.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Sakamachi market rings a hand bell to start the morning auction. Before it rings there is an hour of ice, boots, carts and jokes, and that hour is the episode.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">In this episode</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"is-style-rundown\"} -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list is-style-rundown\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>00:00</strong> <span>Cold open: the bell</span></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>00:04</strong> <span>The hour before the auction</span></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>00:24</strong> <span>Haru Ishida, who has rung the bell for twelve years</span></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>00:44</strong> <span>Letters about early mornings</span></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>00:56</strong> <span>The closing record</span></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"oto-credits\"} -->\n<p class=\"oto-credits\">Recorded by Nao Hoshino. Produced by Emi Tachibana. Mixed by Daichi Arai.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
    },
    {
      "slug": "ten-minutes-of-a-laundromat-at-midnight",
      "title": "Ten minutes of a laundromat at midnight",
      "date": "2026-08-28",
      "categories": [
        "night-walks"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "late-night",
        "field-recording"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/headphones.jpg",
      "excerpt": "Twelve machines, one bench and a radio nobody owns. The episode that brought in more letters than any other.",
      "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"oto-listen\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group oto-listen\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"oto-listen__play\"} -->\n<p class=\"oto-listen__play\"><a href=\"https://feeds.example.com/oto-radio/42\">Listen</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"oto-listen__info\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group oto-listen__info\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"oto-listen__no\"} -->\n<p class=\"oto-listen__no\">Episode 42</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"oto-listen__time\"} -->\n<p class=\"oto-listen__time\">36 min</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-wave\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-wave\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"oto-listen__note\"} -->\n<p class=\"oto-listen__note\">Recorded on location and in Studio B. Plays in your podcast app.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We meant to record for an hour. The ten minutes after midnight, when three dryers finished at once, turned out to be the whole episode, so we played it twice.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">In this episode</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"is-style-rundown\"} -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list is-style-rundown\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>00:00</strong> <span>Cold open: a coin, then a door</span></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>00:02</strong> <span>Ten minutes, uncut</span></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>00:12</strong> <span>The same ten minutes again, with Nao explaining every sound</span></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>00:30</strong> <span>The closing record</span></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"oto-credits\"} -->\n<p class=\"oto-credits\">Recorded by Nao Hoshino. Produced by Emi Tachibana.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
    },
    {
      "slug": "what-a-ferry-horn-sounds-like-from-the-hill",
      "title": "What a ferry horn sounds like from the hill",
      "date": "2026-08-21",
      "categories": [
        "conversations"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "harbour",
        "interview",
        "music"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/host2.jpg",
      "excerpt": "Captain Rin Okabe sounds the last ferry horn of the day. We recorded it from her bridge, and from the hill where the town hears it.",
      "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"oto-listen\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group oto-listen\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"oto-listen__play\"} -->\n<p class=\"oto-listen__play\"><a href=\"https://feeds.example.com/oto-radio/41\">Listen</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"oto-listen__info\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group oto-listen__info\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"oto-listen__no\"} -->\n<p class=\"oto-listen__no\">Episode 41</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"oto-listen__time\"} -->\n<p class=\"oto-listen__time\">55 min</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-wave\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-wave\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"oto-listen__note\"} -->\n<p class=\"oto-listen__note\">Recorded on location and in Studio B. Plays in your podcast app.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The last ferry leaves the harbour at 21:10 and sounds its horn once. On the bridge it is deafening. From the hill above town, Captain Rin Okabe told us, it sounds like someone saying goodnight.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">In this episode</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"is-style-rundown\"} -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list is-style-rundown\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>00:00</strong> <span>Cold open: the horn, from both places at once</span></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>00:04</strong> <span>The bridge of the last ferry</span></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>00:24</strong> <span>Captain Rin Okabe on thirty years of goodnights</span></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>00:44</strong> <span>Letters about the sounds that tell you the time</span></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>00:56</strong> <span>The closing record</span></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>People set their clocks by it. I set mine by them: when the lights go on up the hill, I know they heard.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>Captain Rin Okabe</cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"oto-credits\"} -->\n<p class=\"oto-credits\">Recorded by Nao Hoshino. Produced by Emi Tachibana. Mixed by Daichi Arai.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
    }
